#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:391
#: a339c7bc3dc040cea454ecb75aa82728
msgid "BU01多个设备测距?最大支持多少呢？"
msgstr "BU01 multi-device ranging? What is the maximum supported number?"

#: 67f45ba06f7e4f8aa6e840cc087e066d
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:392
