msgstr "Does BU-01 have a demo for the TDOA positioning algorithm?"

#: 2ed3c1ecdfdd43e9a295d8a490c02540
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:459
msgid "没有，只要TWR定位算法。"
msgstr "No. It only has the TWR positioning algorithm."

#: 73a62528d34a48c3a9b642b4b5ceeca8
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:462
