#: 9e76f3d9ea2e4bd1ace46a50aa21bb8e
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:475
msgid "该程序适配的是我们BU-01开发板，开发板晶振用的是16M的，因此要用16M晶振的开发板驱动即可；"
msgstr ""
"This program is adapted for our BU-01 development board. The development "
"board uses a 16 MHz crystal, so it can be driven by a development board "
"with a 16 MHz crystal."

