#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:507
msgid "UWB是室内室外都可以用吗"
msgstr "Can UWB be used both indoors and outdoors?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:508
#: f5d44bbc3f1842c7967d8ff3ebb51a1d
msgid "是的"
msgstr "Yes."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:511
#: abde9b971f6a40a38ef51ee0af3582d9
msgid "使用BU-01开发板做定位的话，需要买几个？"
msgstr "How many BU-01 development boards should I buy for positioning?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:512
#: ff4acf9fb77548dda87de3b9e8a3bbc4
msgid "一个标签，加3个基站，共4个；"
msgstr "One tag plus three base stations, four in total."

#: 878c40918ac948ea866e098c140e4588
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:515
msgid "BU01模块可以和其他不同牌子的UWB模块通信吗"
msgstr "Can the BU01 module communicate with UWB modules of other brands?"

#: 0867d48b01124059bf994174b1fefab7
