msgstr "Can the BU01 development board guide a cart?"

#: 76d57cdd35b740a3a88f68d293cec55d
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:520
msgid "可以，通过二次开发的方式进行实现"
msgstr "Yes. It can be implemented through secondary development."

#: 34f96fea70c942ee9f75b18eecba04fd
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:523
msgid "请问UWB基站应用部署一般需要几个呢？"
msgstr ""
"How many base stations are generally needed for UWB base station "
"deployment?"

#: 5f93b27605614900b4bd398afbfffb08
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:524
msgid "至少需要3个以上基站。"
msgstr "At least 3 base stations are required."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:527
#: b9983ff1ef9a41b0b88cdea5fcd81a92
