" does only the tag-side serial port return values?"

#: 4b12e26935764cf287dcf487c1924bc7
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:528
msgid "因为只有0号基站才会输出距离信息，其他ID号的基站不会输出"
msgstr ""
"Because only base station No. 0 outputs distance information. Base "
"stations with other IDs do not output it."

#: 3f0a9900b3aa4b968b79197534192784
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:531
msgid "UWB模块可以自动标定基站吗"
msgstr "Can the UWB module automatically calibrate base stations?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:532
#: d3f9a31283c04af6a2de83700bd05938
msgid "模块没有这个功能"
msgstr "The module does not have this function."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:535
#: f1b201a25fff40538dbc86c19b53f298
msgid "UWB模块位置信号一般多久发送一次"
msgstr "How often is the UWB module’s position signal generally sent?"

#: 966a28a7eb79443db75c5fdb405d1590
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:536
msgid "一般1秒钟发送一次位置信息"
msgstr "Generally, position information is sent once per second."

#: 87f08e3b8fc64999b43a356b7af30ff9
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:539
msgid "UWB开发板测距频率能加快吗"
msgstr "Can the ranging frequency of the UWB development board be increased?"

#: 31fe5efa7d884f5dbb3f2425c3a874e9
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:540
msgid ""
"目前代码处理已经是最快的频率，输出频率可以通过AT+interval指令将数值设置到5进行测试  5已经是上限值了  这个值是获取测距数据次数"
"   范围为5-50次  值越大刷新速度越慢"
msgstr ""
"The current code processing is already at the fastest frequency. The "
"output frequency can be tested by setting the value to 5 through the "
"AT+interval command. 5 is already the upper limit. This value is the "
"number of times ranging data is obtained. The range is 5-50 times; the "
"larger the value, the slower the refresh rate."

#: 048502aa1d4b4d288143c2b13af45a89
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:543
msgid "UWB开发板上的加速度传感器还需要额外接入吗"
msgstr ""
"Does the accelerometer on the UWB development board need to be connected "
"separately?"

#: 975e09caf79d4190a6d5f3ae87bed191
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/UWB/index.rst:544
msgid "不需要，我们出厂的板子已经焊接好温湿度和加速度传感器"
msgstr ""
"No. Our factory board already has the temperature/humidity sensor and "
"accelerometer soldered."

#: 7b931596b45d4f53ae498e7b063621dc
